    slug: "behind-the-build-apple-store-fifth-avenue",
    title: "Behind the Build: Who Actually Built Apple Store Fifth Avenue?",
    description: "Apple Store Fifth Avenue is one brand on the marquee \u2014 Apple \u2014 but the project runs on named specialists (Apple, Eckersley O'Callaghan, Foster + Partners, TriPyramid Structures and more). Every supplier link below is verified with source_url + quote.",
